[{"title":"殷公觐招集水西亭仝何行吉詹淑正管象吉洪仲昭杨承之作","author":"佘翔","text":"郭外生秋色，移尊集水西。\n青山悬睥睨，白马驻招提。\n丛桂淮南隐，芙蓉邺下题。\n酣歌犹未已，归路夕阳低。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19659,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄题龙华寺兼柬堪公","author":"佘翔","text":"宝幢山下寺，塔影挂层霞。\n八水分功德，诸天散雨花。\n将诗来入社，得酒便为家。\n悟得无生理，超然转法华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19660,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"缑溪馆中晤王永叔沈生余二明府","author":"佘翔","text":"邮亭开锦帐，尊酒话襟期。\n已下王乔舄，还吟沈约诗。\n烽烟生海上，鸿雁隔天涯。\n把袂休辞醉，重逢定几时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19661,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仙溪舟中报黄德符","author":"佘翔","text":"为访仙源去，兰桡趁晚风。\n山青烟树外，溪碧火云中。\n胜事怀河朔，幽心寄桂丛。\n美人渺何许，临水送飞鸿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19662,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"周元孚邀仝邬汝翼胡应之何长卿黄白仲沈孺林登瓦官寺青莲阁作","author":"佘翔","text":"瓦官名不减，高阁复青莲。\n问法凭支遁，裁诗想谪仙。\n黄图留王气，白浪落人烟。\n宿障除烦恼，皈依不二禅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19663,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同彭玉润游摄山 其一","author":"佘翔","text":"歇马行松径，寻僧度石桥。\n欲窥龙藏胜，不惮虎溪遥。\n踰岭参干佛，看碑辨六朝。\n谁言陶处士，犹待远公招。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19664,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同彭玉润游摄山 其二","author":"佘翔","text":"一片烟萝地，空山涌白莲。\n欲除烦恼障，先辨辟支禅。\n鸟下翻经石，龙沉洗钵泉。\n新诗携谢眺，翘首问青天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19665,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登谷城山","author":"佘翔","text":"春入江山丽，登高醉眼开。\n鹤盘沧海下，人蹑白云来。\n解带悬修竹，飞觞藉落梅。\n漫留金石句，天地妒雄才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19666,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日集欧桢伯青溪馆分得溪字","author":"佘翔","text":"官舍清于水，开尊对木犀。\n地当留笛步，客到浣花溪。\n爽气乘秋入，斜阳度鸟低。\n尚书期不顾，肯惜醉如泥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19667,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈翰卿招集乌山同许伯纶康孟担杨任道作","author":"佘翔","text":"卜筑南山下，开尊醉薜萝。\n兰投湘女佩，雪和郢人歌。\n海岳窗中尽，楼台树杪多。\n翛然发长啸，挥手乱星河。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19668,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日雨中怀陈士传","author":"佘翔","text":"律转青阳候，愁听曙雨声。\n梅花寒自落，柳色嫩初生。\n扑竹惊栖鹤，穿林却啭莺。\n青山招隐处，延眺独含情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19669,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日宿康孟担斋头赋赠","author":"佘翔","text":"爱尔栖迟处，门庭静不哗。\n春生书带草，香染木犀花。\n短榻工文藻，晴窗阅岁华。\n相过偏信宿，有酒不须赊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19670,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郊居即事","author":"佘翔","text":"柴门流水曲，隐几绝逢迎。\n乱竹烟初敛，孤村雨乍晴。\n邻翁分药草，稚子进藜羹。\n谁识幽居处，无营度此生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19671,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄费无学","author":"佘翔","text":"仙才不可见，大雅属斯人。\n斗酒歌相劳，绨袍意独真。\n文章穷屈宋，钟鼎辨周秦。\n别尔匡庐去，千山若比邻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19672,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送立雨叔之海陵","author":"佘翔","text":"三尺芙蓉佩，腰间色陆离。\n那堪千里别，况复九秋时。\n瓜步乘潮兴，芜城吊古诗。\n小山丛桂好，莫忘倚门期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19673,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"海上述怀","author":"佘翔","text":"空门无剥啄，伏枕过今朝。\n病色怀飧菊，生涯寄纬萧。\n月摇湘女佩，风动颍人瓢。\n寂寞玄经在，冥鸿未可招。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19674,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送方伯书游北雍","author":"佘翔","text":"长安多结侠，君去意何如。\n黍谷春吹律，聊城客射书。\n如云瞻璧水，有赋奏公车。\n燕市逢人问，穷愁两鬓疏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19675,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"度新岭作","author":"佘翔","text":"二月且逢闰，披裘犹自寒。\n阴云霾晓日，流水咽高滩。\n马首风尘苦，羊肠道路难。\n青山花渐发，不似故园看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19676,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"京口早发","author":"佘翔","text":"远寺疏钟动，长江片月流。\n客愁眠不得，起视水边楼。\n河汉星将曙，关门柝未休。\n榜人初击楫，西上秣陵州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19677,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"茶洋舟中","author":"佘翔","text":"溪烟飞漠漠，久客荡归舟。\n水落滩声急，天寒曙色浮。\n风尘孤剑暗，戎马十年愁。\n翻怪乡园近，伤心是旧游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19678,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对月有怀","author":"佘翔","text":"爱此清秋月，盈盈水一方。\n青天如挂镜，白露已沾裳。\n波泛蟾宫冷，风飘桂阙香。\n沉吟团扇句，能不断人肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19679,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送吴公挺之建州","author":"佘翔","text":"君向芝城去，云山望几重。\n滩声喧黯淡，秋色冷芙蓉。\n千里怀中剑，扁舟梦里钟。\n溪头明月好，载酒幔亭峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19680,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鄱阳舟中","author":"佘翔","text":"乘槎千里客，一叶下鄱阳。\n雁起闽天迥，烟连楚水长。\n江鱼投网罟，海燕逐帆樯。\n暮雨潇潇急，鸣桡欲断肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19681,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"左蠡雨泊怀彭使君","author":"佘翔","text":"雨中停桂棹，一眺尽重湖。\n巨浸吞吴楚，长鲸伏有无。\n临渊嗟结网，见猎动飞弧。\n何限怀人意，风波咫尺孤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19682,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中柬郑道行","author":"佘翔","text":"二月雨声寒，萧条拥鹖冠。\n疏钟沉别院，独鸟下空坛。\n久客嗟燃桂，深山想采兰。\n君家书带草，何似故园看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19683,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得金沙水同袁履善作","author":"佘翔","text":"一派分阿耨，寒潭九里沙。\n云蒸灵液煖，日动浏纹斜。\n丽水盘初地，恒河露觉花。\n欲将龙井去，支鼎试新茶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19684,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"槜李雪中怀吴翁晋","author":"佘翔","text":"积雪连平野，饥鸦不可闻。\n相如怀授简，小令欲书裙。\n水与银河接，山从玉垒分。\n郢人歌寂寞，此际重思君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19685,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"李节之招饮龙潭仝周希安宋初阳蔡幼公章子敬作","author":"佘翔","text":"别馆临流迥，高楼背阁偏。\n披云星作客，傲世酒称仙。\n孤塔空中起，千家镜里悬。\n何时乘夜雪，重泛剡溪船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19686,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日仝柯大启林晋伯郑若东柯尔珍避暑觉上人兰若","author":"佘翔","text":"曳杖遵南国，言寻白社期。\n龙应沉法水，鸟已集禅枝。\n移席临溪阁，行厨荐露葵。\n远公偏许饮，欲去漫攒眉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19687,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丁丑秋日书事","author":"佘翔","text":"端拱劳清问，谁当万里城。\n戎威骄假道，汉将大徵兵。\n抗疏多新进，运筹属老成。\n禁中频拊髀，颇牧昔时名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19688,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋怀 其一","author":"佘翔","text":"迢递千山道，疏林落日低。\n传书悲塞雁，伏枕听莎鸡。\n双鬓凋风雨，孤城厌鼓鼙。\n东闽何处是，人在楚云西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19689,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋怀 其二","author":"佘翔","text":"西风摇落候，客自滞江城。\n鸿雁三秋泪，蒹葭一水情。\n醒逢渔父问，侠藉酒人名。\n多病销皮骨，熊经学养生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19690,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送丘明华之浙中谒胡参政","author":"佘翔","text":"朔气拥江门，离心那可论。\n数声寒度雁，双泪暗啼猿。\n访古严滩下，探奇禹穴存。\n薇垣知国士，去矣漫销魂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19691,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄余思澄","author":"佘翔","text":"斗酒一为别，江湖叹索居。\n诗曾题五柳，梦每拆双鱼。\n彩笔风云丽，青山岁月虚。\n交情深缱绻，争奈雁来疏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19692,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜呈伯华","author":"佘翔","text":"独坐高楼夜，萧然旅思生。\n井桐秋一叶，城柝月三更。\n剑合雌雄气，诗传鲍谢名。\n山中丛桂在，无日不含情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19693,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泊金沙","author":"佘翔","text":"西风吹瞑色，野雁倚孤舟。\n水气将秋冷，溪声带月流。\n交游虚顾盼，著作老穷愁。\n明发扬帆去，隋珠何处投。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19694,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"木兰陂春泛同尧勋子韩文蔚作","author":"佘翔","text":"春流绿于染，载酒罄交欢。\n沙鸟轻相狎，江花笑未残。\n衣含波影动，曲度柳条寒。\n旷达真吾事，悠然咏考槃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19695,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病后伯华仁甫汝存携酒见访 其一","author":"佘翔","text":"茂陵多病渴，萧瑟更悲秋。\n忽载花间酒，同为月下游。\n露华清欲滴，枫叶老堪愁。\n莫惜如泥醉，风尘易白头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19696,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病后伯华仁甫汝存携酒见访 其二","author":"佘翔","text":"偃蹇长为客，年华伏枕过。\n贫应甘季次，病岂示维摩。\n玉勒停秋草，金卮泛夕波。\n徘徊情不浅，取醉月中歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19697,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄方景武二首 其一","author":"佘翔","text":"塞上悲歌者，相违路几千。\n著书曾入赵，击筑更游燕。\n白羽徵兵日，黄金结客年。\n幕中工草檄，还忆旧青毡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19698,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄方景武二首 其二 题林敷毅立壶图","author":"佘翔","text":"孤鹫界苍烟，凭高思渺然。\n飞云迷古刹，落日俯平田。\n醉拾金光草，閒寻玉乳泉。\n天风吹短袂，缥缈若飞仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19699,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"见二毛作","author":"佘翔","text":"生事惟高枕，萧然已二毛。\n山中歌扣角，花下醉持螯。\n身世穷何碍，风尘梦亦劳。\n但教无俗事，随意读离骚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19700,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对月吟","author":"佘翔","text":"凉风吹海月，皎皎度遥岑。\n映水金波静，穿林玉树阴。\n关山征妇泪，萍梗故人心。\n独坐愁无赖，萧然动客吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19701,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬夜尧勋过访值雷雨大作","author":"佘翔","text":"岁寒风雨夜，兴似剡溪船。\n雷震嘉平月，星缠己夘年。\n酒人吾独老，词客尔堪怜。\n剪烛弹棋罢，联床一醉眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19702,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初夏柬姚明府","author":"佘翔","text":"群木散繁阴，怀人思不禁。\n九华青似黛，几度梦相寻。\n康乐题春草，步兵笑竹林。\n溪头新水至，迟尔一披襟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19703,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀晋安诸子 其一","author":"佘翔","text":"忽忽惊残腊，萧条已二毛。\n自应怀短铗，谁复恋绨袍。\n夜雪深蓬径，寒松泻海涛。\n不知词赋客，何处醉持螯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19704,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀晋安诸子 其二","author":"佘翔","text":"抱病衡门下，孤村岁暮时。\n贫耽元亮酒，老爱建安诗。\n雨雪龙蛇卧，稻梁鸟雀悲。\n无诸二三子，几度梦中期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19705,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏怀呈诸同社 其一","author":"佘翔","text":"青鬓衡门下，朝来雪数茎。\n文章嘲薄俗，贫病寄浮生。\n樗栎元无用，藤萝合有盟。\n中原二三子，鞭弭气纵横。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19706,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏怀呈诸同社 其二","author":"佘翔","text":"吾道穷何甚，年丰亦苦饥。\n江湖交渐薄，蒲柳病相依。\n鹿破隍中梦，鸥忘海上机。\n此生沉浊酒，荷锸未全非。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19707,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏怀呈诸同社 其三","author":"佘翔","text":"夙昔飞扬态，年华去不留。\n七星空佩剑，五月尚披裘。\n翰墨非长技，稻粱那自谋。\n江潭天地意，枯槁未应愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19708,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏怀呈诸同社 其四","author":"佘翔","text":"草玄甘寂寞，谁识子云心。\n十口穷相傍，二毛病不禁。\n风尘空落魄，山水几知音。\n万古江河色，滔滔岂陆沉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19709,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏怀呈诸同社 其五","author":"佘翔","text":"伏枕朝慵起，蓬蒿一径存。\n妻孥亲井臼，裘葛失寒温。\n药自频增减，诗多废讨论。\n幸无车马迹，终日闭柴门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19710,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏怀呈诸同社 其六","author":"佘翔","text":"咄咄书空日，明时一病夫。\n岁华徂薜荔，生事老江湖。\n兴剧还看竹，心冥似据梧。\n向来羁五斗，空自辱泥涂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19711,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仝赵献武林洁甫饮仲仁宅","author":"佘翔","text":"谁道元龙傲，相逢意转亲。\n但教千日醉，莫笑百年贫。\n风雨能留客，烟花不负人。\n夜来占太史，星已聚荀陈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19712,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戊子夏日祝士会招集信州北楼仝祝士南汪季美次唐人李郢韵","author":"佘翔","text":"登楼愁作赋，把酒喜看山。\n双鸟窥人下，孤云度陇还。\n凶荒何日定，贫病此生閒。\n醉里行吟客，悠悠恋故关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19713,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨后怀陈尧勋","author":"佘翔","text":"空斋听雨夜，芳树转秋声。\n拥褐饶寒色，谈诗忆友生。\n扁舟湖海兴，斗酒薜萝情。\n那得狂相傍，长歌对月明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19714,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中写闷","author":"佘翔","text":"漠漠黄梅雨，芝城五月秋。\n湿薪吹不起，平础涨堪愁。\n岁俭惊千里，家贫梦一丘。\n谁能鞭日驭，长笑弄扁舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19715,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旅病","author":"佘翔","text":"焚香聊晏坐，旅食计萧然。\n不分薪如桂，更嗟屋似船。\n愁来脂髓尽，老至雪霜偏。\n身世已如此，无劳问九天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19716,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病后柬陈季迪","author":"佘翔","text":"白发长为客，孤灯暗抱疴。\n据床亲药裹，伏枕想渔蓑。\n生计浮云薄，乡心积雨多。\n明朝逢竞渡，无奈独醒何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19717,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"午日谢性卿招集斋中薄暮登楼赋此","author":"佘翔","text":"竞渡逢佳节，多君折简招。\n艾符方在户，莆酒且盈瓢。\n对榻挥玄麈，登楼拂斗杓。\n左徒遗恨在，千载未能消。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19718,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"坐雨柬吴师文","author":"佘翔","text":"一榻嗟容膝，其如雨不堪。\n人多愁桂玉，天岂漏东南。\n逆旅怜同病，余生抱独惭。\n囊中阿堵物，沽酒向谁酣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19719,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦雨柬魏伯建","author":"佘翔","text":"连朝依枕簟，积雨几时乾。\n榴火枝头暗，茶烟竹里寒。\n尊生甘社栎，佞佛礼旃檀。\n为问参同子，何时振羽翰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19720,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中不得过季迪却寄","author":"佘翔","text":"昨日花间酌，高谈碣石宫。\n今朝云卧处，徒自叹飘蓬。\n投辖情何限，操瓢兴不穷。\n所嗟风雨恶，一水渺丝桐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19721,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题栟榈寺","author":"佘翔","text":"礼佛寻龙藏，逢僧入虎溪。\n诸天空色相，双树是菩提。\n拂麈花初散，摊经日未西。\n白莲堪结社，临去独留题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19722,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"武彝逢钟明府","author":"佘翔","text":"仙子栖真处，烟霞别有天。\n金芝悬五岳，玉牒祝千年。\n叶县窥丹灶，桃源泛钓船。\n风流归茂宰，紫气望翩翩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19723,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"武霞纪游 其一","author":"佘翔","text":"鼓枻逢渔火，披衣混鹿群。\n松含千嶂雨，草乱一溪云。\n茅狗从天下，金鸡隔水闻。\n幔亭张乐处，欲叩武夷君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19724,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"武霞纪游 其二","author":"佘翔","text":"长啸窥丹壑，寻幽入翠微。\n风停鸾鹤驾，露湿薜萝衣。\n谢豹穿林去，桃花夹岸飞。\n闲来寻钓艇，不待乞渔矶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19725,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"武霞纪游 其三","author":"佘翔","text":"朅来停杖屦，访道上清宫。\n翠落空潭水，涛生万壑风。\n芝苓罗斗口，鸡犬驻云中。\n即此堪招隐，何须问八公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19726,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"武霞纪游 其四","author":"佘翔","text":"黄冠偏爱客，载酒泛青溪。\n春暖花争发，云深鸟自啼。\n芝童调石髓，玉女进刀圭。\n兴剧贪杯斝，挥戈日未西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19727,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"武霞纪游 其五","author":"佘翔","text":"铁笛吹何处，临风促落梅。\n虹桥人不见，华表鹤初回。\n九转留仙蜕，千秋辨劫灰。\n当年刘阮辈，曾否到天台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":19728,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]